"      Declaration of the Main company of the User currently Logged in Based on\n"
"      Fiscal year.\n"
"\n"
"        **Path to access:** Invoicing/Reporting/Legal Reports/Belgium Statements/Annual Listing Of VAT-Subjected Customers\n"
"\n"
